          "en": "I already want to leave this example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.59,
          "end": 12.88,
          "en": "because that really is all I think we should know for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.88,
          "end": 16.13,
          "en": "of how View's reactivity works under the hood.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.13,
          "end": 20.17,
          "en": "It's not all we should know about View in general, though;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.17,
          "end": 22.93,
          "en": "for example, you might have wondered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.93,
          "end": 26.88,
          "en": "if you can only have one view app per page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 30.5,
          "en": "and maybe you already tried out working with multiple apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.5,
          "end": 35.04,
          "en": "because yes, you can have multiple apps. Here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.04,
          "end": 37.98,
          "en": "and thus far in all the lectures and modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.98,
          "end": 40.68,
          "en": "we just haven't had one app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.68,
          "end": 45.07,
          "en": "and we mounted that to one part of our HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.07,
          "end": 48.14,
          "en": "which would then be controlled by that app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.14,
          "end": 52.67,
          "en": "But you can absolutely have more than one app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.67,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "if you wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.53,
          "end": 57.64,
          "en": "So if we add a second section here with an idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.64,
          "end": 62.64,
          "en": "of app two, we can absolutely create a second app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.77,
          "end": 67.633,
          "en": "maybe name it app two here with View Create App,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.53,
          "end": 73.53,
          "en": "which we mount to this app two ID section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.93,
          "end": 77.75,
          "en": "And in here, we can do the exact same thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.75,
          "end": 79.503,
          "en": "as we did in our first app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.93,
          "end": 83.7,
          "en": "We can also return the data object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.7,
          "end": 87.36,
          "en": "We can have a data property here, like a favorite meal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 87.36,
          "end": 92.07,
          "en": "pizza and, we can then of course, output this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 96.47999999999999,
          "en": "in our second app, the favorite meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 99.4,
          "en": "If we do all of that and saved it and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 99.4,
          "end": 102.21000000000001,
          "en": "here is our second app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 102.21000000000001,
          "end": 103.53999999999999,
          "en": "Now it's missing the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.53999999999999,
          "end": 108.53999999999999,
          "en": "because I actually set the styling up to target the app ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.19,
          "end": 112.77000000000001,
          "en": "But if we would target the app two ID as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.77000000000001,
          "end": 116.72999999999999,
          "en": "we would get the exact same styling as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.72999999999999,
          "end": 120.68,
          "en": "So, if you quickly find all the places into styled CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 120.68,
          "end": 123.29,
          "en": "where we target the app ID selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 123.29,
          "end": 127.853,
          "en": "simply add the two ID selector with a comma as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 130.25,
          "end": 135.25,
          "en": "Also, here and here. And of course all the 40 input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 138.72,
          "end": 141.72,
          "en": "If you plan on using one in your second app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 141.72,
          "end": 143.23,
          "en": "and all the other styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 143.23,
          "end": 145.62,
          "en": "Now, since I don't use a buttons on in my second app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 145.62,
          "end": 148.12,
          "en": "I'll omit this. And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 148.12,
          "end": 151.5,
          "en": "if I reload, we see this in a nicer style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 155.61,
          "en": "Now, of course, you can't use data from another app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 155.61,
          "end": 158.51,
          "en": "So, here in my app, two, in this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 158.51,
          "end": 160.46,
          "en": "which is controlled by the second app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 160.46,
          "end": 162.76,
          "en": "I can't output the message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 162.76,
          "end": 165.52,
          "en": "which is part of the data of the first app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.52,
          "end": 169.14,
          "en": "This does not work. If I do that, you see nothing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 169.14,
          "end": 172.41,
          "en": "because the message is not a data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 172.41,
          "end": 173.64,
          "en": "of the second app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 173.64,
          "end": 175.25,
          "en": "It's one of the first app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.25,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "And these two apps have no connection,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 179.82999999999998,
          "en": "which is important, by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.82999999999998,
          "end": 182.88,
          "en": "Each view app works stand alone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.88,
          "end": 185.56,
          "en": "There is no connection between them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 185.56,
          "end": 187.55,
          "en": "These are really two different parts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.55,
          "end": 189.9,
          "en": "of your HTML code, controlled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 193.78,
          "en": "by two different apps with no connection between the apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 193.78,
          "end": 197.9,
          "en": "So this here does not work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 199.44,
          "end": 202.633,
          "en": "because this is the data from another app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.1,
          "end": 207.13,
          "en": "And therefore, multiple View apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.13,
          "end": 209.72,
          "en": "are definitely something you might want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.72,
          "end": 214.14,
          "en": "If you have different independent parts on your screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.14,
          "end": 216.11,
          "en": "that should be controlled by View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 216.11,
          "end": 218.8,
          "en": "If you have a part that needs to work together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.8,
          "end": 221.06,
          "en": "though, for example, an input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.06,
          "end": 222.5,
          "en": "which is connected to the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.5,
          "end": 225.59,
          "en": "which ultimately influences what's in the paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225.59,
          "end": 229.12,
          "en": "If you that, then this all should be controlled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 229.12,
          "end": 231.223,
          "en": "by the same app. Of course.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
